  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Smart Water, Sanitation and Hygiene Activity (CS-WASH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity aims to improve health and resilience in Tajikistan through increased sustainable access to safe drinking water in rural communities for 60,000 people and improve sanitation in targeted communities (the scale and budget allocation for this task will be identified after analysis). To ensure sustained service provision, the activity will rehabilitate 20 small-scale infrastructure projects and establish reliable and commercially viable water service operators for each system. These systems will be gender sensitive and climate-resilient.</narrative>
  </description>
